# context-pilot demo — recorded with vhs (charmbracelet.dev/vhs)

Output demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 960
Set Height 600
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 30
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

# Run context-pilot against the kern project (dry run)
Type "node dist/index.js ~/Developer/projects/kern --dry-run"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

# Select "Cursor" (second option — press down once, then enter)
Down
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Stack confirmation — press Enter for "Yes"
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Project purpose
Type "A mobile AI chat app connecting to OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google using the user's own API keys"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Key patterns
Type "Zustand slices for state, NativeWind for styling, expo/fetch for SSE streaming"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Gotchas
Type "Never use FadeIn/FadeOut on ternary components, no @expo/vector-icons"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Snapshot: select "Yes, auto-detect key files" (first option, already selected)
Enter
Sleep 3s

# Let it finish and show the output
Sleep 5s
